###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_2e0b0f1b_ba90_4827_af5a_92b826cb90de
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_2e0b0f1b_ba90_4827_af5a_92b826cb90de> rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ;
