                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "\"3 cm\""@en ,
                                                                                                                """A more complete example showing how to specify the value of a physical quantity in turtle using this datatype:

    height1 a emmo:Height ;
        hasSIQuantityValue \"3 cm\"^^emmo:SIQuantityDatatype ."""@en ;
                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "SIQuantityDatatype"@en ;
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> "A datatype for a specifying a physcial quantity as a string consisting of a numerical, a separator and an SI unit."@en ;
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f> "The unit should be a valid, possible prefixed, derived SI unit."@en .


