###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_662c64e7_fc72_49b3_a161_f50fd42deafa
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_662c64e7_fc72_49b3_a161_f50fd42deafa> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
