                                                                  rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_dd4a7f3e_ef56_466c_ac1a_d2716b5f87ec> ;
                                                                  rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_847724b7_acef_490e_9f0d_67da967f2812> ;
                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasMetrologicalUncertainty"@en ;
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> "Assigns a quantifiable uncertainty to an objective property through a well-defined procecure."@en ;
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f> "Since measurement uncertainty is a subclass of objective property, this relation can also describe the uncertainty of an measurement uncertainty."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_663859e5_add3_4c9e_96fb_c99399de278d
