                                                                                   <https://w3id.org/emmo/perspectives/semiotics#> ;
                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "isInterpretantFor"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_8a9b62df_e1ee_463b_bd1c_9fd9a572e970
