                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_31252f35_c767_4b97_a877_1235076c3e13> "An indirect cause is a relation between two entities that is mediated by a intermediate entity. In other words, there are no quantum parts of the causing entity that are direct cause of quantum parts of the caused entity."@en ;
