###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_4b2c223f_89fb_4407_b1b6_24774b7fe770
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_4b2c223f_89fb_4407_b1b6_24774b7fe770> rdf:type owl:Class ;
