###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_592b1d98_4736_4cac_9b62_849b8dbe11c7
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_592b1d98_4736_4cac_9b62_849b8dbe11c7> rdf:type owl:Class ;
