###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_5c15f8c4_d2de_47a0_acdd_470b8dda979b
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_5c15f8c4_d2de_47a0_acdd_470b8dda979b> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_70bbb94e_2ca7_4d73_ba01_6397f134d172> ,
