###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_6f5af708_f825_4feb_a0d1_a8d813d3022b
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_6f5af708_f825_4feb_a0d1_a8d813d3022b> rdf:type owl:Class ;
