###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_81e767f1_59b1_4d7a_bf69_17f322241831
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_81e767f1_59b1_4d7a_bf69_17f322241831> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_2946d40b_24a1_47fa_8176_e3f79bb45064> ,
                                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_af794e9d_dc7d_4756_83e1_2cd0e2ec864e> ,
                                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                    owl:onProperty <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_bed1d005_b04e_4a90_94cf_02bc678a8569> ;
                                                                                    owl:someValuesFrom <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_1c2226a9_22f0_40c8_8928_5a01d398f96e>
                                                                                  ] ;
                                                                  rdfs:comment """For an atom or nucleus, this energy is quantized and can be written as:

    W = g μ M B

where g is the appropriate g factor, μ is mostly the Bohr magneton or nuclear magneton, M is magnetic quantum number, and B is magnitude of the magnetic flux density.

-- ISO 80000"""@en ;
                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "MagneticDipoleMoment"@en ;
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_1f1b164d_ec6a_4faa_8d5e_88bda62316cc> "http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MagneticDipoleMoment" ;
