<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_8533871a_01e4_4935_8c7b_cedf8fcc3fa3> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_8c537c06_8e1d_4a3b_a251_1c89bb2c4790>
