###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_ecc10f05_b301_4dcf_8c84_b6f511117234
<https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_ecc10f05_b301_4dcf_8c84_b6f511117234> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_6ab555fd_5803_4f03_82e8_127c01aabfea> ;
                                                                  rdfs:comment "Process for joining two (base) materials by means of an adhesive polymer material" ;
                                                                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/emmo/disciplines/manufacturing#> ;
                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Kleben" ;
