###  https://w3id.org/emmo#Gray
<https://w3id.org/emmo#Gray> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                             rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_0266ec8c_bd13_4c9c_be77_607498793ed3> ,
                                             <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_1abe0ea7_2378_402f_b950_89b0795d2f45> ,
