                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64> "H/m" ;
                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> """The henry per meter (symbolized H/m) is the unit of magnetic permeability in the International System of Units ( SI ). Reduced to base units in SI, 1 H/m is the equivalent of one kilogram meter per square second per square ampere.

-- QUDT"""@en ;
