###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/battery#battery_10702b58_1640_439a_8db6_ffda82beda70
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/battery#battery_10702b58_1640_439a_8db6_ffda82beda70> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/battery#battery_a4ba7f50_5fe0_43f4_9862_4dd57e87a44c> ,
