###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/battery#battery_c25c3fb4_14ce_4640_abcc_d4a6e641fee4
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/battery#battery_c25c3fb4_14ce_4640_abcc_d4a6e641fee4> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/battery#battery_a4ba7f50_5fe0_43f4_9862_4dd57e87a44c> ,
