###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#CharacterisationEnvironment
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#CharacterisationEnvironment> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_65a007dc_2550_46b0_b394_3346c67fbb69> ,
