###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#LevelOfAutomation
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#LevelOfAutomation> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                     rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_909415d1_7c43_4d5e_bbeb_7e1910159f66> ;
                                                                                     rdfs:comment "Describes the level of automation of the test."@en ;
