                                                                                         rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/characterisation-methodology/chameo#Voltammetry> ;
                                                                                         rdfs:comment "Voltammetry in which the current is recorded as the electrode potential is varied linearly with time. LSV corresponds to the first half cycle of cyclic voltammetry. The peak current is expressed by the Randles-Ševčík equation. The scan is usually started at a potential where no electrode reaction occurs."@en ;
