                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Often used in lithium-ion cell characterisation; especially significant for graphite, silicon, and other anode materials that form an SEI layer on the first cycle."@en ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_4c8480cf_56de_41da_8699_f12a9033313a> "Captures irreversible first-cycle losses that permanently reduce deliverable capacity and cannot be recovered by subsequent cycling. Must not be conflated with CoulombicEfficiency measured in later cycles."@en ;
