                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f> "in cylindrical lithium-ion cells the safety vent is typically realised as a scored membrane or rupture disc in the cap assembly; venting is irreversible"@en .


