                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Dissolution of metallic copper as Zn^{2+} during corrosion or anodization."@en ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "It can be regarded as the reversal of electrodeposition."@en ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Electrodissolution"@en ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_f0c24970_4c14_4207_bd78_5f2181a67085> ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> "the electrochemical dissolution of a material to soluble species"@en .

