###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_4ebe2ef1_eea8_4b10_822d_7a68215bd24d
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_4ebe2ef1_eea8_4b10_822d_7a68215bd24d> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_17b031fb_4695_49b6_bb69_189ec63df3ee> ,
