###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_53616dc6_b921_4beb_9ab2_cafa4ba16406
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_53616dc6_b921_4beb_9ab2_cafa4ba16406> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_5c78b424_087b_4e31_8c91_6422f1be1e86> ,
                                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_9c657fdc_b9d3_4964_907c_f9a6e8c5f52b> ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:comment "This is the thermodynamic electromotive force of the cell. The measured open-circuit voltage approaches it as the cell relaxes, but need not reach it, for example when an electrode rests on a hysteresis branch."@en ;
