                                                                                                                                                     "EquilibriumCellPotential"@en ,
                                                                                                                                                     "ReversibleCellVoltage"@en ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "EquilibriumCellVoltage"@en ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_7fe804b8_6126_4132_be8f_b4985d61b1f6> ,
                                                                                                                                                    <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_d91940f0_c8b6_4505_9b68_6bf6cfc5c544> ,
                                                                                                                                                    <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_fe3a6c9a_85b8_4da6_aa4f_71c8de74939e> ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> "open-circuit voltage of a cell when all interfacial charge-transfer equilibria are established; equal to minus the reaction Gibbs energy divided by the charge number and the Faraday constant, and to the difference of the equilibrium electrode potentials of the two electrodes"@en .


