                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "CapacityFadePerCycle"@en ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "neither IEC nor IUPAC define a fade-rate quantity; this class codifies common practice in the battery literature, where capacity fade is reported per cycle or per unit of time"@en ;
