                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> "the rate at which the deliverable capacity of a cell decreases as a consequence of capacity fade, expressed per cycle or per unit of time"@en .


