###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_7418a464_839a_4679_afcb_e0f1030f6149
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_7418a464_839a_4679_afcb_e0f1030f6149> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_17b031fb_4695_49b6_bb69_189ec63df3ee> ,
                                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_2d896559_eee3_447c_9759_87c854a4266a> ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "OpenCircuitVoltageHysteresis"@en ;
                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_9c657fdc_b9d3_4964_907c_f9a6e8c5f52b> ,
