                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Used to characterise power capability and resistive losses under pulsed discharge conditions; a standard output of the Hybrid Pulse Power Characterisation (HPPC) protocol."@en ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> "Internal resistance of an electrochemical cell determined from the voltage response to a direct-current pulse, calculated as ΔV/ΔI at a specified elapsed time after pulse onset."@en ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_b6730304_cabc_4104_b415_14218466445c> "Values are not directly comparable between measurements made with different pulse durations or current magnitudes. Measurement conditions must be reported alongside the value."@en .


