                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A half-cell becomes operational when paired with at least one other half-cell to form an electrochemical cell; the pair allows charge balance through ionic and electronic pathways."@en ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_0fa6566e_500f_4d24_baa9_b2b22c9a0b72> "Do not conflate an ElectrochemicalHalfCell (the combination of one electrode and one electrolyte) with a half-cell device, which is an experimental setup used to measure the properties of an electrode relative to a reference electrode."@en ;
