                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_4c8480cf_56de_41da_8699_f12a9033313a> "A single half-cell cannot sustain continuous current by itself; closed-circuit operation requires a counter half-cell and an external electronic path."@en ;
