                                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Used in battery cycling to express the ratio of the charge delivered during discharge to the charge supplied during the preceding charge. Not to be confused with FaradaicEfficiency, the fraction of the total charge that contributes to a specific reaction."@en ;
