                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9> "vent of special design which provides protection against the propagation of a flame front from or into the interior of a secondary cell"@en ;
                                                                                                      <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f> "this flame front may originate from a spark or an external naked flame igniting combustible electrolysis gas"@en .

