###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_ae9882de_d6a2_4525_a84f_80947c10f1cb
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_ae9882de_d6a2_4525_a84f_80947c10f1cb> rdf:type owl:Class ;
