###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_d3c0078e_c1d3_461e_873d_e5c3adf441c5
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_d3c0078e_c1d3_461e_873d_e5c3adf441c5> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_9b3b4668_0795_4a35_9965_2af383497a26> ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_8abde9d0_84f6_4b4f_a87e_86028a397100> ,
