###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_f330680b_347e_45b3_9113_5ce09d18d60b
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_f330680b_347e_45b3_9113_5ce09d18d60b> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_f76884f7_964e_488e_9bb7_1b2453e9e817> ;
